{"seq":2,"slug":"operator-lifecycle-manager","title":"Operator Lifecycle Manager 与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-lifecycle-manager","wordCount":1033,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"operator-lifecycle-manager-与分发\">Operator Lifecycle Manager 与分发</h1><p>Operator Lifecycle Manager（OLM）解决 Operator 的&quot;最后一公里&quot;问题：如何在不同集群中安装、升级、管理依赖和控制权限。OLM 为 Operator 建立了类似&quot;应用商店&quot;的生态——用户从目录中发现 Operator，一键安装，自动接收升级，而 Operator 开发者通过标准化的打包格式（Bundle）发布版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>OLM</strong>：Operator 的&quot;应用商店&quot;基础设施——安装、升级、依赖解析、权限隔离</li>\n<li><strong>ClusterServiceVersion</strong>：一个 Operator 版本的完整描述（权限、部署、CRD、UI 元数据）</li>\n<li><strong>Bundle</strong>：CSV + CRD + metadata 打包为容器镜像的标准分发格式</li>\n<li><strong>Channel</strong>：升级通道（stable/alpha），通过 replaces/skips 链定义版本升级路径</li>\n<li><strong>CatalogSource</strong>：Operator 目录（类似 apt repo），OLM 从中发现可安装的 Operator</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"olm-的核心概念\">OLM 的核心概念</h2><p>OLM 引入了一组 CRD 来管理 Operator 的生命周期：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CAT[CatalogSource] --&gt; SUB[Subscription]&#10;    SUB --&gt; IP[InstallPlan]&#10;    IP --&gt; CSV[ClusterServiceVersion]&#10;    CSV --&gt; DEP[Operator Deployment]&#10;    CSV --&gt; CRD[CRD 安装]&#10;    CSV --&gt; RBAC[RBAC 配置]\">flowchart TD\n    CAT[CatalogSource] --&gt; SUB[Subscription]\n    SUB --&gt; IP[InstallPlan]\n    IP --&gt; CSV[ClusterServiceVersion]\n    CSV --&gt; DEP[Operator Deployment]\n    CSV --&gt; CRD[CRD 安装]\n    CSV --&gt; RBAC[RBAC 配置]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CRD</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CatalogSource</td>\n<td>Operator 目录（类似包管理器的 repo）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subscription</td>\n<td>订阅某个 Operator 的特定 channel（如 stable/alpha）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InstallPlan</td>\n<td>安装计划：需要创建哪些资源来安装/升级 Operator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClusterServiceVersion</td>\n<td>一个 Operator 版本的完整描述（权限、依赖、UI 元数据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OperatorGroup</td>\n<td>定义 Operator 的作用域（单 namespace / 全集群）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"clusterserviceversion-csv\">ClusterServiceVersion（CSV）</h2><p>CSV 是 Operator 版本的核心元数据文件——它声明了 Operator 需要什么权限、管理哪些 CRD、如何部署、如何从前一版本升级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: operators.coreos.com/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ClusterServiceVersion&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: database-operator.v1.2.0&#10;  annotations:&#10;    alm-examples: |&#10;      [{&quot;apiVersion&quot;:&quot;database.example.com/v1&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;Database&quot;,&quot;metadata&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;sample&quot;},&quot;spec&quot;:{&quot;replicas&quot;:3}}]&#10;spec:&#10;  displayName: Database Operator&#10;  description: 管理 PostgreSQL 集群的完整生命周期&#10;  version: 1.2.0&#10;  replaces: database-operator.v1.1.0 # 升级链&#10;&#10;  install:&#10;    strategy: deployment&#10;    spec:&#10;      deployments:&#10;        - name: database-operator&#10;          spec:&#10;            replicas: 2&#10;            template:&#10;              spec:&#10;                containers:&#10;                  - name: manager&#10;                    image: registry.example.com/database-operator:v1.2.0&#10;&#10;  customresourcedefinitions:&#10;    owned:&#10;      - name: databases.database.example.com&#10;        version: v1&#10;        kind: Database&#10;        displayName: Database&#10;        description: PostgreSQL 集群实例&#10;&#10;  installModes:&#10;    - type: OwnNamespace&#10;      supported: true&#10;    - type: SingleNamespace&#10;      supported: true&#10;    - type: MultiNamespace&#10;      supported: false&#10;    - type: AllNamespaces&#10;      supported: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">operators.coreos.com/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterServiceVersion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator.v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    alm-examples</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      [{\"apiVersion\":\"database.example.com/v1\",\"kind\":\"Database\",\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"sample\"},\"spec\":{\"replicas\":3}}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  displayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Database Operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">管理 PostgreSQL 集群的完整生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator.v1.1.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 升级链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  install</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      deployments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">manager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">registry.example.com/database-operator:v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  customresourcedefinitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    owned</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">databases.database.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        displayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PostgreSQL 集群实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  installModes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OwnNamespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      supported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SingleNamespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      supported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">MultiNamespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      supported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AllNamespaces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      supported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"operator-bundle-格式\">Operator Bundle 格式</h2><p>Bundle 是 OLM 的标准打包格式——将 CSV、CRD YAML 和 metadata 打包为一个容器镜像：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-operator-bundle/&#10;├── manifests/&#10;│   ├── database-operator.clusterserviceversion.yaml&#10;│   ├── databases.database.example.com-crd.yaml&#10;│   └── database-operator-metrics-reader-rbac.yaml&#10;├── metadata/&#10;│   └── annotations.yaml&#10;└── Dockerfile\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-operator-bundle/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── manifests/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── database-operator.clusterserviceversion.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── databases.database.example.com-crd.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── database-operator-metrics-reader-rbac.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── metadata/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── annotations.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Dockerfile</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 构建 Bundle 镜像&#10;make bundle IMG=registry.example.com/database-operator:v1.2.0&#10;make bundle-build bundle-push BUNDLE_IMG=registry.example.com/database-operator-bundle:v1.2.0&#10;&#10;# 构建 Catalog（包含多个 Bundle）&#10;opm index add \\&#10;    --bundles registry.example.com/database-operator-bundle:v1.2.0 \\&#10;    --tag registry.example.com/database-operator-catalog:latest\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建 Bundle 镜像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundle</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> IMG=registry.example.com/database-operator:v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundle-build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundle-push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> BUNDLE_IMG=registry.example.com/database-operator-bundle:v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建 Catalog（包含多个 Bundle）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --bundles</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/database-operator-bundle:v1.2.0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    --tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> registry.example.com/database-operator-catalog:latest</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产物</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Operator Image</td>\n<td>Controller 二进制</td>\n<td>运行时执行调谐逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bundle Image</td>\n<td>CSV + CRD + metadata</td>\n<td>描述一个版本的安装方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalog Image</td>\n<td>多个 Bundle 的索引</td>\n<td>作为 CatalogSource 供 OLM 发现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"升级策略与通道\">升级策略与通道</h2><p>OLM 通过 <strong>Channel</strong> 和 <strong>replaces/skips</strong> 链实现版本升级：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph stable channel&#10;        V1[v1.0.0] --&gt; V11[v1.1.0] --&gt; V12[v1.2.0]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph alpha channel&#10;        A1[v1.0.0] --&gt; A2[v1.1.0-rc1] --&gt; A3[v1.1.0] --&gt; A4[v1.2.0-rc1]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph stable channel\n        V1[v1.0.0] --&gt; V11[v1.1.0] --&gt; V12[v1.2.0]\n    end\n    subgraph alpha channel\n        A1[v1.0.0] --&gt; A2[v1.1.0-rc1] --&gt; A3[v1.1.0] --&gt; A4[v1.2.0-rc1]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>replaces</code></td>\n<td>明确指定从哪个版本升级（形成线性链）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>skips</code></td>\n<td>允许跳过中间版本直接升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>skipRange</code></td>\n<td>允许从某个版本范围内任意版本升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>升级审批模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: operators.coreos.com/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Subscription&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: database-operator&#10;spec:&#10;  channel: stable&#10;  name: database-operator&#10;  source: operator-catalog&#10;  sourceNamespace: olm&#10;  # Manual: 需要管理员手动审批 InstallPlan&#10;  # Automatic: 自动升级（适用于非生产环境）&#10;  installPlanApproval: Manual\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">operators.coreos.com/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Subscription</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">operator-catalog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sourceNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">olm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Manual: 需要管理员手动审批 InstallPlan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Automatic: 自动升级（适用于非生产环境）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  installPlanApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Manual</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"依赖管理\">依赖管理</h2><p>OLM 支持 Operator 间的依赖声明——如果你的 Operator 依赖 cert-manager 提供证书管理，可以在 CSV 中声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"spec:&#10;  customresourcedefinitions:&#10;    required:&#10;      - name: certificates.cert-manager.io&#10;        version: v1&#10;        kind: Certificate&#10;        displayName: Certificate&#10;        description: 需要 cert-manager 提供 TLS 证书管理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  customresourcedefinitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">certificates.cert-manager.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Certificate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        displayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Certificate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">需要 cert-manager 提供 TLS 证书管理</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OLM 会自动解析依赖关系——如果 cert-manager 尚未安装，OLM 会从可用的 CatalogSource 中找到并自动安装它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"operatorhub-与社区分发\">OperatorHub 与社区分发</h2><p>OperatorHub.io 是 Operator 的公共目录，任何人可以提交自己的 Operator 供社区使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分发渠道</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>准入门槛</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OperatorHub.io</td>\n<td>开源 Operator 公共分发</td>\n<td>通过自动化测试 + 人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red Hat Marketplace</td>\n<td>企业商业 Operator</td>\n<td>认证流程 + 安全扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有 Catalog</td>\n<td>企业内部 Operator</td>\n<td>无门槛，自建 Catalog Image</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>提交到 OperatorHub 的要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bundle 格式正确（通过 <code>operator-sdk bundle validate</code>）</li>\n<li>包含 <code>alm-examples</code>（示例 CR）</li>\n<li>包含有效的 <code>icon</code> 和 <code>description</code></li>\n<li>CRD 有完整的 OpenAPI schema</li>\n<li>通过 Scorecard 测试</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"olm-的替代方案\">OLM 的替代方案</h2><p>OLM 并非唯一的 Operator 分发方案。对于不需要完整生命周期管理的场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OLM</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>企业级分发、多租户、权限隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helm Chart</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>简单部署、社区分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kustomize + GitOps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>GitOps 工作流、声明式管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接 kubectl apply</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>开发/测试环境、单集群</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：如果你的 Operator 需要在 OpenShift 生态分发，OLM 是必选。如果仅在自有集群使用，Helm + ArgoCD 通常更简单且灵活。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本发布流程\">版本发布流程</h2><p>一个标准的 Operator 版本发布流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[代码变更] --&gt; B[CI: test + build]&#10;    B --&gt; C[构建 Operator Image]&#10;    C --&gt; D[构建 Bundle Image]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更新 Catalog Image]&#10;    E --&gt; F[推送到 Registry]&#10;    F --&gt; G[提交 PR 到 OperatorHub]\">flowchart LR\n    A[代码变更] --&gt; B[CI: test + build]\n    B --&gt; C[构建 Operator Image]\n    C --&gt; D[构建 Bundle Image]\n    D --&gt; E[更新 Catalog Image]\n    E --&gt; F[推送到 Registry]\n    F --&gt; G[提交 PR 到 OperatorHub]</pre><p>每个版本发布需要更新：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Operator 容器镜像（新的 Controller 代码）</li>\n<li>Bundle 镜像（新的 CSV + 可能的 CRD 变更）</li>\n<li>Catalog 索引（包含新 Bundle 的目录）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OLM 为 Operator 提供了标准化的分发与生命周期管理：通过 Bundle 格式打包版本、通过 Channel 管理升级路径、通过 Subscription 控制审批策略、通过 CatalogSource 发现可用 Operator。对于 OpenShift 生态或需要企业级分发的场景，OLM 是标准选择；对于自有集群的简单场景，Helm + GitOps 可能更轻量。版本发布流程包括构建 Operator Image → Bundle Image → Catalog Index 三层产物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"operator-testing\">Operator 测试策略与实践</a>——发布前的质量保证</li>\n<li><a href=\"operator-observability\">Operator 可观测性</a>——发布后的运行时监控</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Operator Lifecycle Manager 与分发","id":"operator-lifecycle-manager-与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OLM 的核心概念","id":"olm-的核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ClusterServiceVersion（CSV）","id":"clusterserviceversion-csv"},{"level":2,"text":"Operator Bundle 格式","id":"operator-bundle-格式"},{"level":2,"text":"升级策略与通道","id":"升级策略与通道"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖管理","id":"依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"OperatorHub 与社区分发","id":"operatorhub-与社区分发"},{"level":2,"text":"OLM 的替代方案","id":"olm-的替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"版本发布流程","id":"版本发布流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Operator 测试策略与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-testing"},"next":{"title":"Operator 可观测性建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/operations/operator-observability"}}